    "notes": [
        {
            "title": "First patch!",
            "date": "2024-10-25 18:00:21",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/6212245217911868091",
            "notes": "Implemented:\nFPS limit, separate from vertical synchronization.\nFOV customization. \nAbility to disable crosshair.\nBloom customization."
        },
        {
            "title": "Release!",
            "date": "2024-10-24 15:06:20",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/6212245217911831205",
            "notes": "The game is already available at 20% off!\nIt's been a long journey, but here we are.\n\nWe hope you enjoy the game!"
        },
        {
            "title": "Demo update!",
            "date": "2024-09-08 05:01:50",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/6242640076607028255",
            "notes": "[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/41721856/d5b951b8cab6bd708323fd813db877eb0c6c9cc1.png[/img]\nThe demo has been updated.\nChanges:\n-Added a new location, nightmare (warped complex).\n-Added a new entity. (It is not so easy to detect, the chance of appearance is not 100%.)\n-Fixed some bugs."
        },
        {
            "title": "The demo is available now!",
            "date": "2023-11-11 12:00:37",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/5302486388005951402",
            "notes": "The demo is already available for playthrough!\n\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/41721856/0f19fdb07fcf5eb69bf206116eda6f0656aa4134.png[/img]\n\nIn the demo is the beginning of the game, it will take up to an hour to get through.\n\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/41721856/54731d3094241e7f848b4851dc98526f439fe376.png[/img]\n\nYou get to travel to an abandoned complex and meet the first entities of \"Polygon of Reality\"!\n\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/41721856/dbe925d7178632cea9450db7cea83044806849ef.png[/img]\n\n[url=https://t.me/DarkGamesDGG]Telegram[/url]\n[url=https://discord.gg/HbENnt7qtF]Discord[/url]"
        },
        {
            "title": "DEMO version release date.",
            "date": "2023-11-09 03:13:47",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/5302486387997326987",
            "notes": "[h1]The DEMO version of the game is scheduled to be released on November 11th, at 12pm EST.[/h1]\n\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/41721856/0a3c32b333ef36fe3cbb4a386820c0fff49a2c2c.png[/img]\n\nYou will travel to a long-forgotten research complex and face your nightmares, in the form of entities from other dimensions. \n\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/41721856/7dca06d7830285d20358b07d8954ddef4baeb8f0.png[/img]\n\nIn the DEMO version you will have access to the beginning of the game, which takes up to an hour to complete. \n\n[url=https://t.me/DarkGamesDGG]Telegram[/url]\n[url=https://discord.gg/HbENnt7qtF]Discord[/url]"
        },
        {
            "title": "Postponing the game's release and opening the beta testing enrollment.",
            "date": "2023-08-28 10:26:53",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/5141475722341871264",
            "notes": "The game's release date is being pushed back to 2024.\nThere are several reasons for this, the main ones being:\n-The increased demands on the quality of the game.\n-Unforeseen circumstances that occurred this year.\n\nHowever, even though the game is postponed to the year 24, a public demo will be available in Q4!\nThe demo is scheduled to be released by November 30th.\nAlso, we are now open for closed testing of the part of the game that will be in the demo: https://forms.gle/LkZLCaH13s1DuWGZ6\nClosed testing of the demo will start on January 15."
        },
        {
            "title": "New Polygon of Reality trailer is available now!",
            "date": "2023-08-21 22:55:01",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/5127964289189568962",
            "notes": "A new trailer for the game \"Reality Polygon\" has been released!\nIn it you can see the updated state of the game, unlike the last trailer, which was already 6 months old.\nThe last trailer was hidden from Steam page, but it will still be available on Youtube channel.\nThe new trailer will also be uploaded to Youtube soon, in 4K resolution.\nThe new trailer will be available in English and Russian."
        },
        {
            "title": "The game description has been updated.",
            "date": "2023-07-28 12:41:53",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/5124584686250249728",
            "notes": "-Added subsections.\r\n-Updated images in the description.\r\n-The last image has been replaced with a GIF."
        },
